# Static checks on Grove's C++, run by bin/lint; any finding fails it.
#
# Every family that finds bugs is on: bugprone, the Clang static analyzer
# (including its leak and use-after-free checks), performance, modernize, and
# most of readability, misc and the C++ Core Guidelines. A check is off only
# when it fights how this code is meant to read, and the reason is below.
#
# Off, and why:
#  - magic-numbers: the landscape, light and sound are tuned constants, each
#    explained where it is used; naming every one would hide the numbers the
#    comments talk about.
#  - identifier-length: the drawing math uses W, H, u, t and x as geometry does.
#  - math-missing-parentheses: precedence in arithmetic is not in doubt.
#  - braces-around-statements, isolate-declaration, trailing-comma,
#    avoid-nested-conditional-operator: house style (CODING_STANDARDS.md)
#    allows an unbraced single statement, several related declarations on one
#    line, and a chain of conditions that reads as a table.
#  - function-cognitive-complexity: each paint() is one picture drawn in
#    order, best read top to bottom rather than split into fragments.
#  - easily-swappable-parameters: geometry takes several doubles in a row.
#  - include-cleaner: Qt's headers include one another in ways it cannot map.
#  - non-private-member-variables: the Look structs are plain values on
#    purpose, copied to the drawing thread whole.
#  - owning-memory: Qt objects are owned by their parent, not by a gsl::owner.
#  - pro-bounds-avoid-unchecked-container-access, pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,
#    pro-bounds-constant-array-index: indexing within loops bounded by the
#    container's own size, and scanning raw PCM and image rows, which
#    AddressSanitizer checks at run time in bin/check-leaks.
#  - modernize-use-trailing-return-type: not this code's style.
#  - modernize-use-nodiscard: Qt's getters do not use it, and ours follow them.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  modernize-*,
  readability-*,
  misc-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  -*-magic-numbers,
  -readability-identifier-length,
  -readability-math-missing-parentheses,
  -readability-braces-around-statements,
  -readability-isolate-declaration,
  -readability-trailing-comma,
  -readability-avoid-nested-conditional-operator,
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -*-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -cppcoreguidelines-owning-memory,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-avoid-unchecked-container-access,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-constant-array-index,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -modernize-use-nodiscard
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: '.*/grove/src/.*'
